Discard a single Wan tile with few left, keep others.\n3. **Play T8**: Discard a tile with very few left (1 in wall), low chance.\n\nBest choice: Play T4, as it\u2019s a middle tile with moderate wall count (4 T4 left), but it doesn\u2019t contribute much to potential patterns (like sequences with T3/T5 are less likely given my hand). Keeping W8 might allow a potential W7-W8-W9 sequence, but W9 is depleted (0 left), so unlikely. Keeping T8 could pair if I draw the last T8, but low probability. T4 discard keeps options open for Wan-based hand or others.\n\nAnswer: Play T4"}
